#!/bin/sh
# Fake skopeo. inspect prints the digest in $FAKE/digest/<ref key>, or fails without one;
# copy to oci: makes the directory (fails if $FAKE/fail_download exists); copy to
# containers-storage: tags the image, recording the source it came from.
echo "skopeo $*" >> "$FAKE/calls"
key() { printf %s "$1" | tr '/:@' '___'; }
cmd=$1
shift
while [ "${1#-}" != "$1" ]; do
  case $1 in
    --authfile) cp "$2" "$FAKE/authfile"; shift 2 ;;
    *) shift ;;
  esac
done
case $cmd in
  inspect)
    f="$FAKE/digest/$(key "${1#docker://}")"
    [ -f "$f" ] || exit 1
    printf '{"Digest": "%s"}\n' "$(cat "$f")"
    ;;
  copy)
    case $2 in
      oci:*) [ ! -e "$FAKE/fail_download" ] || exit 1; mkdir -p "${2#oci:}" ;;
      containers-storage:*) echo "$1" > "$FAKE/images/$(key "${2#containers-storage:}")" ;;
    esac
    ;;
esac
